Historical generals and admirals for France that the base game leaves out, each with an AI-assisted portrait made from a historical photograph. The first release adds three generals and one admiral who sided with the Allies in 1942-43; a fourth general follows later.

[h2]Companion mod: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3832953557]Event Pack: France[/url][/h2]
Historical flavor events for France, from the same author.

